OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry for most
OL,6,Fbut the odd light shower in the north
OL,7,Fpossible. Long clear spells in the
OL,8,Fevening but turning cloudier
OL,9,Fovernight. Cold and frosty.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FA mostly dry and cloudy day
OL,12,Fwith bright or sunny intervals
OL,13,Fbreaking through. The odd shower
OL,14,Fpossible but these mainly around the
OL,15,Fnorthern coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
